    <!-- Sign out. Placement, copy and component per 23-account-rework.md 2 / 6.6 / 6.8 and
         15-account-tab.md 1286-1288: the last group on the tab, a destructive row with no value
         and no chevron, opening a themed confirm dialog whose primary action is the verb «Выйти»
         (never «OK», never «Да»/«Нет»; 00-rules.md 7.5 and the ThemeOverlay.Departament.Dialog
         comment in styles.xml).

         The group is «Аккаунт и вход», not «Вход»: a header meaning "sign IN" over a row that
         signs OUT is the contradiction 23-account-rework.md 6.6 calls out by name. It is also not
         «Аккаунт» on its own, which would just restate the tab's own nav label.

         Two bodies because the tab has two truthful shapes here (00-rules.md 15): signing out
         drops a live tunnel, and saying so when there is no tunnel would be noise. -->
    <string name="account_group_signin">Аккаунт и вход</string>
    <string name="account_row_logout">Выйти</string>
